@startuml
' === STYLE SETTINGS ===
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 25
skinparam boxPadding 15
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' Color coding for roles
actor " Regular\nUser" as User #LightBlue
actor " Group\nOwner \n(moderator)" as Org #LightGreen
actor " Group\nMember" as Member #LightYellow
actor " Platform\nAdmin" as Admin #LightCoral

' System components with friendly descriptions
participant " Website" as Client #LightGray



participant " Server" as Server #LightGray


database " Database" as DB #LightGray
participant " Notification\nService" as Notify #LightGray
participant " Email\nService" as Email #LightGray

' === LEGEND ===
title 📊 Student Queue Management - Process Flow
header
    <size:10>🔵 - user action
    🟢 - request to server
    🟡 - database operation
    🟠 - notification
    🔴 - response to user</size>
end header

' ===============================================
' 🟣 SCENARIO 1: REGISTRATION
' ===============================================
participant Member(next)

==  NEW USER REGISTRATION ==

User -> Client: 1️⃣ Enters email and password\nin the sign-up form
note right: Wants to create an account

Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends registration data\nto the server
activate Server

Server -> DB: 3️⃣ Saves new user information\nin the database
DB --> Server: ✅ User saved

Server -> Email
activate Email
Email --> User
deactivate Email

Server --> Client
deactivate Server
Client --> User

|||
User -> Client
Client -> Server
Server -> DB
Server --> Client



' ===============================================
' 🟣 SCENARIO 3: CREATING A GROUP
' ===============================================
==  USER CREATES A NEW GROUP (AND BECOME GROUP OWNER)==

note right: Name, description,\nprivacy settings

User -> Client: 1️⃣ Fills out the\n"Create Group" form
Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends group data\nto the server
activate Server

Server -> Server

Server -> DB: 4️⃣ Saves the new group\nin the database
DB --> Server: ✅ Group created successfully

Server --> Client: 5️⃣ "Group created\nsuccessfully!"
deactivate Server


' ===============================================
' 🟣 SCENARIO 4: JOINING A PRIVATE GROUP (FULL FLOW)
' ===============================================
Client --> User: 📱 Shows success message
==  USER REQUESTS TO JOIN A GROUP ==

User -> Client: 1️⃣ Clicks "Join Group"\nand writes a message
note right: Wants to join\na closed study group

Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends join request\nto the server
activate Server

Server -> DB: 3️⃣ Saves the request with\nstatus "pending approval"
DB --> Server: ✅ Request saved

Server -> Notify: 4️⃣ Notifies the group owner and moderator\nabout new request
activate Notify
Notify --> Org: "Someone wants\nto join your group"
deactivate Notify

Server --> Client: 5️⃣ "Your request has been\nsent to the group owner and moderator"
deactivate Server
Client --> User: Shows "Request pending"

|||
==  GROUP OWNER OR MODERATOR REVIEWS AND DECIDES ON REQUEST ==

Org -> Client: 6️⃣ Opens notifications\nand sees the join request
note right: Can see applicant's profile\nand their message

Client -> Server: 7️⃣ Requests full details\nof the pending request
activate Server

Server -> DB: 8️⃣ Fetches request details\nand applicant information
DB --> Server: User profile + request message

Server --> Client: 9️⃣ Displays applicant info\nfor group owner (moderator) to review
deactivate Server
Client --> Org:  Shows profile and\n"Approve" / "Reject" buttons

|||
Org -> Client: 🔟 Clicks "Approve" or "Reject"
note right: Makes a decision\nabout the applicant

Client -> Server: 1️⃣1️⃣ Sends decision to server\n(approve/reject + optional note)
activate Server

alt ✅ ORGANIZER APPROVES
    Server -> DB: 1️⃣2️⃣ Updates request status\nto "approved"
    Server -> DB: 1️⃣3️⃣ Adds user as a member\nof the group
    DB --> Server: ✅ Membership created
    
    Server -> Notify: 1️⃣4️⃣ Notifies the user\nabout approval
    activate Notify
    Notify --> User: "You've been approved!\nYou're now a group member"
    deactivate Notify
    
    Server --> Client: 1️⃣5️⃣ "User has been added\nto the group"
    Client --> Org:  Shows "Member added"
    
else ❌ ORGANIZER REJECTS
    Server -> DB: 1️⃣2️⃣ Updates request status\nto "rejected"
    DB --> Server: ✅ Request marked as rejected
    
    Server -> Notify: 1️⃣3️⃣ Notifies the user\nabout rejection
    activate Notify
    Notify --> User: "Your request to join\nwas not approved"
    deactivate Notify
    
    Server --> Client: 1️⃣4️⃣ "Request has been rejected"
    Client --> Org:  Shows "Request rejected"
end
deactivate Server

|||
==  USER RECEIVES NOTIFICATION AND SEES RESULT ==

User -> Client: 1️⃣6️⃣ Opens the app\nand checks notifications

alt ✅ If approved
    Client --> User:  Shows "Welcome to the group!\nYou can now participate"
    note right: User gains access to\ngroup events and queue
    
else ❌ If rejected
    Client --> User:  Shows "Your request\nwas not approved"
    note right: User can reapply later\nor look for other groups
end
' ===============================================
' 🟣 SCENARIO 5: QUEUE MANAGEMENT
' ===============================================
==  GROUP MEMBER INTERACTS WITH THE QUEUE ==

group JOINING THE QUEUE
    Member -> Client: 1️⃣ Clicks\n"Join Queue"
    Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends request to server
    activate Server
    
    Server -> DB: 3️⃣ Checks:\n- Is the queue open?\n- Already in queue?
    
    alt ✅ Can join
        DB --> Server: All checks passed
        Server -> DB: 4️⃣ Adds user to queue
        Server --> Client: 🔄 Updates queue for\nall members
        Server --> Client: 5️⃣ "You're in the queue!\nPosition: #3"
        Client --> Member: Shows new position
        
    else ❌ Cannot join
        DB --> Server: Queue closed or\nalready in queue
        Server --> Client: "Cannot join queue"
        Client --> Member: Shows reason
    end
    deactivate Server
end

group 🔤 YIELDING A SPOT
    Member -> Client: 1️⃣ Clicks\n"Yield My Spot"
    Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends request to server
    activate Server
    
    Server -> DB: 3️⃣ Updates queue positions
    Server -> Notify: 4️⃣ Notifies the next person\n"Your turn is approaching"
    activate Notify
    Notify --> Member(next):  Alert
    deactivate Notify
    
    Server --> Client: 🔄 Sends updated queue\nto all members
    Server --> Client: 5️⃣ "You've yielded your spot"
    deactivate Server
    Client --> Member:  Shows updated queue
end

' ===============================================
' 🟣 SCENARIO 7: ADMIN MODERATION
' ===============================================
==  ADMINISTRATOR DELETES A USER ACCOUNT ==

Admin -> Client: 1️⃣ Finds the user\nclicks "Delete Account"
Client -> Server: 2️⃣ Sends delete command
activate Server

Server -> Server: 3️⃣ Verifies admin privileges\n(is this really an admin?)

Server -> DB: 4️⃣ Deletes user and all\nrelated data
note right: Their groups, requests,\nqueue positions

Server -> DB

Server -> Notify: 5️⃣ Notifies the deleted user\nabout account removal
activate Notify
Notify --> User: "Your account has\nbeen blocked"
deactivate Notify

Server --> Client: 6️⃣ "User successfully deleted"
deactivate Server
Client --> Admin: Shows confirmation

' === FOOTER WITH LEGEND ===
footer 
    <size:10> Quick Guide:
    Regular User - browses groups, requests to join
    Group Organizer - creates and manages groups/events
    Group Member - joins queues, yields spots
    Admin - manages the platform, handles violations</size>
end footer

@enduml